        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">According to ASTRA (2025), project specific data related to study "Anwendung der Ökobilanz-Methode für die Infrastruktur von Nationalstrassen".\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter cantilever retaining wall with a height of 5.4 meters. It includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of cantiliever retaining wall.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
